Here's a few interesting ways to die in Nethack that I came up with:

Everone knows that you can be "killed by a visit to hell," but did you
realize that you can also be killed because you "went to heaven pre-
maturely?"

Also, being killed by a falling or closing drawbridge is fairly obvious,
but did you know you can also be killed by an exploding or collapsing
drawbridge, or even be killed by falling off the drawbridge?

Or... did you know that you can be...
   "Killed by swallowing a cockatrice whole."
   "Killed by an iron ball collision."
   "Killed by a carnivorous bag."
   "Killed by a potion of holy water.
   "Killed by an electric chair."

Fun, eh?

